# Node shapes: each tree's frontmatter, declared once.
# structure-check reads this file, and so does `sphere` when it writes a focus.md.
# Change a tree's frontmatter and its block here in the same commit (spec/nodes.md, "The shape check").
#
#   tree <name>
#   nodes folder <dir>          each subfolder of <dir> is a node (and each subfolder of <dir>/archived)
#   nodes file <dir> [deep]     each .md file in <dir> is a node; deep: at any depth
#   current <file>              folder nodes: the current-state file, which carries the frontmatter
#   history <file>              folder nodes: the history file
#   keys <key>...               keys every node has, even when empty, in this order; <key>? marks one it may leave out
#   optional <key>...           more keys a node may leave out (anywhere)
#   archived <key>...           keys a node has exactly when it's in <dir>/archived
#   values <key> <value>...     the only values <key> may take (its first word is checked)
#   format <key> <kind> [arg]   name (= the node's name), date (YYYY-MM-DD), int (0 or more),
#                               version (<major>.<minor>), list [item-pattern], list+ [item-pattern] (one or more)
#   name <pattern>              node names (file name without .md, or folder name) match this pattern
#   skip <name>...              folders or files under <dir> that aren't nodes of this tree
#
# structure-check reads frontmatter and folder listings only, never bodies, and skips <dir>/archived
# unless asked (--archive). Rules beyond these lines (idea, plan, focus) live in sphere_shapes.py.
#
#   kind history <file>...      history files by name: append-only, merged by union, never reversed
#   kind reference <prefix>...  reference files: changed only on the human's yes; a revert proposes, never writes

tree focus
nodes folder layers/focus
current focus.md
history history.md
keys number name aka parent status intention holds through operating-mode collaboration-mode persona points-at opened
values status open closed

tree lens
nodes file core/protocol/lenses
keys lens version version_note derives_from status updated verified sharing frames
values status active drafting deprecated
values verified true false
values sharing public protected private

tree frame
nodes file core/protocol/frames deep
keys frame kind lens derives_from version version_note status updated sharing reads writes protocol
values kind guard instinct structural
values status active drafting deprecated
values sharing public protected private
skip SKILL.md README.md

tree idea
nodes file layers/ideas
name ^\d{8}-[a-z0-9]+(-[a-z0-9]+)*$
keys idea title captured topics stage refinements refined? related? outcome? change? horizon?
archived outcome
format idea name
format captured date
format topics list ^[a-z0-9-]+(\.[a-z0-9-]+)*$
format refinements int
format refined date
format related list
values stage raw shaping ready
values outcome graduated parked
values change add refactor drop
values horizon now soon someday

tree plan
nodes folder layers/work/plans
current plan.md
history history.md
keys plan title parent? for state version summary created updated
format plan name
format for list+ ^work:\S+$
format version version
format created date
format updated date
values state active done dropped

kind history history.md progress.md
kind reference layers/knowledge/ core/protocol/ core/user/
